            "description": "Watch Charlotte Independence vs Chattanooga Red Wolves SC highlights and goals from USL Championship on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 18, 2026. The USL Championship delivered a feast of football as Charlotte Independence squared off against Chattanooga Red Wolves SC . It was a contest defined by tactical shifts and clinical finishing, leaving the crowd breathless as the momentum swung violently between the two sides. Second Half Fireworks Following a competitive opening on July 18, 2026 , the match truly ignited in the second period. The visiting Chattanooga Red Wolves SC came out with renewed intent, and their persistence paid off in the 51st minute. A. Lombardi found the back of the net to level the score at 1-1, injecting a new sense of urgency into the game. Lombardi wasn't finished, however; just eleven minutes later, in the 62nd minute, he struck again to give his side a 1-2 lead and put the home defense under immense pressure. Resilience and a Late Decider Charlotte Independence refused to go down without a fight, showing incredible character to find a way back into the match almost immediately. In the 66th minute, J. Skinner pounced on an opportunity to slot home the equalizer, making it 2-2 and setting the stage for a grandstand finish. The atmosphere intensified as both teams pushed for a winning goal in a wide-open final quarter of an hour. As the clock ticked toward full-time, the drama reached its peak. In the 88th minute, P. Hernandez delivered a clinical finish to restore the lead for Chattanooga Red Wolves SC at 2-3. With Charlotte Independence committing bodies forward in a desperate search for another leveler, they were caught vulnerable at the back. In the fourth minute of stoppage time (90+4'), a final goal hammered home the visitors' advantage, sealing a 2-4 victory in what will be remembered as a classic encounter."
